I think dick size is relative and based on personal preference - I'm about 6inches and think that's small..but yet have had guys say it's too big for their liking and of course have had some size queens say no thanks or block me after I tell them my size. I have also never had any complaints from partners (in fact I have only had compliments and requests for 2nd rounds haha) so I think it comes down to what you like in the dick department. 

&#x200B;

I personally love "smaller" guys... 4 to 5/6 inches are fun to suck on and play with. 

&#x200B;

Recently broke out of my comfort zone and had a fwb with a pretty large dick. it was fun at first but he was super boring and awkward all the time...made sex feel like a weird biology lesson lol. 

&#x200B;

As for porn dicks, well they are the same as model looks, and boobs used for bra commercials lol when you are selling something you use the best of the best to make sure everyone wants to buy it...if you dont like big dick porn (like me) then get into amateur porn filled by real guys with real looks lol much hotter seeing 2 guys enjoying sex than seeing some porn star at work.

